  "description": "IROKAF crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C270 H178 Dy8 N2 O52,6(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy7 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy8 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.719-3.848 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 101.79-109.68°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C270H178Dy8N2O52·6H2O.",
